  "body": "For reasons that are unclear to me, we only use a single thread with sqlite by default (see [here](https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/release-v1.18.0/synapse/config/database.py#L94)). \r\n\r\nI feel like this may be responsible for some of the poor performance seen with sqlite.",
